<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> <span>›</span> Cookie Policy</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
<p style="color:var(--gray-500);margin-bottom:32px">Last updated: January 2025</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:12px">What Are Cookies?</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help the site remember your preferences and provide a better browsing experience.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Cookies We Use</h2>
<div style="overflow-x:auto;margin-bottom:20px">
<table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.9rem">
  <thead><tr style="background:var(--navy);color:#fff">
    <th style="padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;border-radius:var(--radius) 0 0 0">Cookie Name</th>
    <th style="padding:12px 16px;text-align:left">Type</th>
    <th style="padding:12px 16px;text-align:left">Purpose</th>
    <th style="padding:12px 16px;text-align:left;border-radius:0 var(--radius) 0 0">Duration</th>
  </tr></thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-700)">abhyaas_session</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-500)">Essential</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-700)">Maintains your session state</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-500)">Session</td>
    </tr>
    <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)">
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-700)">abhyaas_cookie_consent</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-500)">Preference</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-700)">Remembers your cookie consent choice</td>
      <td style="padding:12px 16px;color:var(--gray-500)">1 year (localStorage)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Managing Cookies</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px">You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings. However, disabling essential cookies may prevent the site from functioning correctly.</p>

<h2 style="color:var(--navy);margin:28px 0 12px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:var(--gray-700);line-height:1.9">For questions about our use of cookies, contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= school.email %>" style="color:var(--green)"><%= school.email %></a>.</p>
</div></section>
